# CCTV REVIEW SUMMARY — CAM10 (PAKWAN/PALWAN CROSS ROAD)

## 1. SCENE
Cam10 overlooks Pakwan/Palwan Cross Road, a busy urban junction, for a 60-minute period (mins 0–59). Footage covers approximately 11:00–12:00 local time (near-gridlock timing given as 11:20–11:24 at mins 50–54). Lighting is full daytime. The camera captures the junction approaches, queued traffic, crossings and the verge.

## 2. TRAFFIC AND PEOPLE
The entire hour showed very heavy mixed traffic:
- **Cars**: dozens per minute, predominantly white, plus silver, grey, black, red, maroon and one pink/red noted (min 50).
- **Two-wheelers**: large numbers of helmeted riders on motorcycles/scooters throughout; an Ola electric scooter (min 7); a rider carrying a gas cylinder (min 9); a woman in red/pink on a two-wheeler, right side (min 54).
- **Auto-rickshaws**: several green-and-yellow autos every minute in Part 1; up to 8–10 per minute in Part 2; 6–10 at a time in Part 3. Goods three-wheelers: blue (mins 2, 31, 39, 42–44), yellow (min 50), orange/yellow tipper (min 51), green "PRINCE" carrier (min 59).
- **Buses**: white Tata bus (min 7); yellow Eicher "NIRMA UNIVERSITY" bus (min 24, and stationary in foreground mins 25–27); blue/yellow "Where Practice Meets Theory" bus (min 24); red city buses with Gujarati LED displays (mins 26, 31, 43–45); red BRTS-style bus (min 27).
- **Goods vehicles**: grey "LUCKY" cargo truck (min 19); white "Rudra" box van (min 2); large white Tata goods truck (min 4); white goods tempo with yellow tarpaulin (min 14); "SHRIGI GOODS CANVAS" truck (min 25); "PREMIUM EDIBLE [OILS]"/"PREMIUM CABLES" canopy truck (mins 40–42); "RASHI DEWAXED PREMIUM EDIBLE OILS" truck (min 42); white "GOODS CARRIAGE" vans (mins 42–45); white "Jamnagar Transport Co." truck (min 59); cement mixer/tanker trailer (mins 43–44); concrete mixer, container truck and tipper (min 21); white Tata tipper (min 24).
- **Agricultural/construction**: red tractor with tanker trailer (min 12); red tractor with blue tanker/bowser (mins 32, 42); yellow JCB-type construction vehicle (min 54, 0–5s).
- **Emergency/official**: white SML ambulance-type van with light bar (min 0); white ambulance top-left (min 58, ~5s); white police/traffic van with light bar (min 59, ~45s); police vehicle with red-blue light bar (min 49).
- **Pedestrians**: continuous crossing and verge-walking throughout, mostly between lanes rather than at crossings (details in Sections 5 and 7). A woman with a small child in red (min 0); woman in red patterned dress (min 21); woman in red sari (min 58, ~20–50s), among many others.

No collisions were observed at any point.

## 3. VEHICLES IDENTIFIED

### CONFIRMED
- Toyota Innova MPV, white, plate GJ09 DK 4402, in junction traffic — min 6
- Hyundai i20, silver, plate GJ10TW3350, in junction traffic — min 8
- Tata Nexon, white, plate GJ27DH2330, in junction traffic — min 14
- Mercedes-Benz E-Class, black, plate GJ03 ER 0480, in junction traffic — min 17
- Toyota Innova MPV, white, plate GJ01WD7138, in queue — min 42
- Suzuki Swift, white, plate partially GJ-17-VF-2793, facing camera — min 55
- Tata Nexon, white, plate partially visible (GJ-series), in traffic — min 56
- Audi SUV, white, four rings legible, plate partially GJ18BN, in traffic — min 58
- Police/traffic van, white, light bar, plate GJ18GB8757, visible at junction — min 59

### PROBABLE (unconfirmed)
- WagonR-style hatchback, white (unconfirmed) — min 2
- Ford EcoSport-class SUV, dark grey (unconfirmed) — min 5
- Mahindra Thar-type, black (unconfirmed) — min 11
