- Hyundai Creta-class SUV, red (unconfirmed) — min 57
- Tata Nexon-class SUV, dark grey (unconfirmed) — min 57

## 4. REGISTRATIONS READ
All entries below are single automatic reads, not verified against any registry.
- GJ01BY5129 — min 1 — red Hyundai hatchback
- GJ01KF0322 — min 2 — white WagonR-style hatchback
